WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.687 --> 00:00:10.231
<b>If you find yourself asking ChatGPT</b>

2
00:00:10.231 --> 00:00:12.358
<b>to do the same thing every day,</b>

3
00:00:12.358 --> 00:00:14.819
<b>turn it into a scheduled task.</b>

4
00:00:14.819 --> 00:00:18.489
<b>With ChatGPT Work, I can create a scheduled task</b>

5
00:00:18.489 --> 00:00:21.367
<b>to handle it automatically whenever I choose:</b>

6
00:00:21.367 --> 00:00:24.245
<b>hourly, daily, weekly, you name it.</b>

7
00:00:24.245 --> 00:00:26.247
<b>Let me show you how I use one</b>

8
00:00:26.247 --> 00:00:27.707
<b>to get ready for my meetings</b>

9
00:00:27.707 --> 00:00:29.751
<b>before the day even starts.</b>

10
00:00:29.751 --> 00:00:33.212
<b>I'm using the desktop app, but you can also do this</b>

11
00:00:33.212 --> 00:00:37.467
<b>in ChatGPT Work on the web or mobile at chatgpt.com.</b>

12
00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:41.471
<b>For this, ChatGPT needs to use my calendar and email.</b>

13
00:00:42.305 --> 00:00:44.390
<b>I'll open Plugins and make sure</b>

14
00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:47.560
<b>Google Calendar and Gmail are connected.</b>

15
00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:50.396
<b>If either one isn't, I'll select Install</b>

16
00:00:50.396 --> 00:00:51.522
<b>and connect my account.</b>

17
00:00:51.981 --> 00:00:53.983
<b>Before I schedule anything,</b>

18
00:00:53.983 --> 00:00:56.778
<b>I want to make sure the result is actually useful.</b>

19
00:00:57.028 --> 00:01:00.740
<b>I'll ask ChatGPT to look at today's meetings,</b>

20
00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.283
<b>find relevant emails,</b>

21
00:01:02.283 --> 00:01:05.078
<b>and make me a short brief for each one.</b>

22
00:01:07.205 --> 00:01:09.957
<b>Great. That's exactly what I need.</b>

23
00:01:09.957 --> 00:01:12.960
<b>Now I'll ask ChatGPT to do the same thing</b>

24
00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:15.213
<b>every weekday at nine.</b>

25
00:01:16.381 --> 00:01:19.300
<b>Now if I open Scheduled in the sidebar</b>

26
00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:21.969
<b>I can see the task, the schedule,</b>

27
00:01:21.969 --> 00:01:23.930
<b>and when it's running next.</b>

28
00:01:24.347 --> 00:01:26.516
<b>I can change the time, pause it,</b>

29
00:01:26.516 --> 00:01:28.351
<b>or remove it whenever I want.</b>

30
00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:31.979
<b>You can also use scheduled tasks with skills.</b>

31
00:01:32.313 --> 00:01:35.274
<b>A skill remembers how I like the work done.</b>

32
00:01:35.691 --> 00:01:38.653
<b>The scheduled task decides when it happens.</b>

33
00:01:38.653 --> 00:01:40.947
<b>I'm updating the scheduled task</b>

34
00:01:40.947 --> 00:01:43.199
<b>to use my meeting prep skill,</b>

35
00:01:43.199 --> 00:01:46.369
<b>so the document is formatted exactly how I like.</b>

36
00:01:47.412 --> 00:01:51.124
<b>You can use the same idea for a twice a day</b>

37
00:01:51.124 --> 00:01:52.583
<b>an urgent inbox check</b>

38
00:01:53.418 --> 00:01:55.503
<b>Finding cool events in the city</b>

39
00:01:56.712 --> 00:01:59.048
<b>Or hunting for sold out tickets</b>

40
00:01:59.048 --> 00:02:01.050
<b>to a show you've been wanting to see</b>

41
00:02:02.051 --> 00:02:04.846
<b>Just say what you want and when you want it.</b>

42
00:02:05.221 --> 00:02:07.557
<b>Same routine, way less effort.</b>

43
00:02:07.557 --> 00:02:09.620
<b>That's ChatGPT Work.</b>
